  "returningVisitor": {
    "_readme": "The button clicker runs each page twice: as a first visit (empty storage, so the welcome cards come up after about 900 ms, hence firstVisitWaitMs) and as a returning visitor, with these saved so the welcome cards stay away and it reaches the notebook itself. The Eye asks for the photographer's details once, on first launch, and shows a tip the first time each tab opens, so those are marked as seen too. modalSelectors: while one of these is open the clicker only uses what's inside it (The Eye's popups are .modal-overlay without aria-modal).",
